  CLAUSE 4 -- THE RUNG: does the protocol teach AT ALL? T0.RET on axis_sep
  +0.5875 +- 0.1500 = 3.9 SE above zero: PASS. (§51 read +0.5295 at 1.8M and +0.0583
  at 150k, so the MAGNITUDE is budget-dependent and is NOT the bar -- a 2 SE
  test asks what the rung means.) On the FORMANT primary §51 measured T0 at
  -0.0059, so T0 is predicted NULL OR NEGATIVE here and reads +0.0235 +- 0.0324;
  a LARGE POSITIVE T0 would contradict §51's ruler calibration.

