    T1.ORACLE - T1.ORACLE.D   +0.1613  (paired SE 0.0493, 3.3 SE)   <-- CEILING

    (4) THE SOUND-ONLY CAREGIVER TEACHES, AND §51's NULL WAS THE RULER.
    T1.RET - T1.RET.D +0.1101 = 2.9 SE on the quantity a listener hears, with
    the ceiling at +0.1613 = 3.3 SE. T1 reaches 68% of it. The caregiver
    compared two SOUNDS and never looked at the toy; the binding came from
    CO-OCCURRENCE. CHECK THE OTHER BUDGET BEFORE QUOTING THIS -- the dose axis
    is pre-registered precisely because this estimator's SD grows with ticks.

